[{"_id":"69beaedd05a4f1fa942be7d8","id":"bguzzo2k/nyt_100y_news_headlines","author":"bguzzo2k","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-03-22T22:10:26.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"eb600a9e11a68adec10e62bf998709812db0dc9a","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tNew York Times 100 Years of News Headlines (1927-2026)\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains approximately 100 years of New York Times news headlines and abstracts, ranging from 1927 to January 2026. It is designed for time-series analysis, NLP tasks, and historical research.\nHugging Face Dataset Page: bguzzo2k/nyt_100y_news_headlines\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nThe dataset consists of metadata for articles published by The New York Times. It captures the \"Main\" headline and the… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/bguzzo2k/nyt_100y_news_headlines.","downloads":209,"tags":["language:en","license:apache-2.0","size_categories:10M<n<100M","format:parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:dask","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","news","nlp","titles","abstract","nyt","corpus","headlines","pre-training"],"createdAt":"2026-03-21T14:44:45.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6967d92f58a9216ec1edf51d","id":"KalsusEvening/financial-news-headlines","author":"KalsusEvening","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-01-15T12:25:29.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"c7a288bdfb0026989d40bab0401be6f32eedfa81","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tFinancial News Headlines Dataset\n\t\n\nA synthetic dataset of 10,038 financial news headlines with sentiment, sector, and topic labels — designed for NLP tasks like sentiment analysis, text classification, and semantic search.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t📊 Dataset Overview\n\t\n\nThis dataset was generated using google/flan-t5-base from HuggingFace for a Data Science course project. Each headline is paired with rich metadata including sector, sentiment, topic, and company name.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tFeatures… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/KalsusEvening/financial-news-headlines.","downloads":182,"tags":["task_categories:text-classification","language:en","license:mit","size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:csv","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","finance","news","headlines","sentiment-analysis","synthetic-data"],"createdAt":"2026-01-14T17:58:07.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"636927cf7f319ce35732570e","id":"olm/gdelt-news-headlines","author":"olm","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2022-12-08T00:13:57.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"7397c9bfe9ce877e4e9f6f1a69991d75ee8f7dde","downloads":181,"tags":["size_categories:10M<n<100M","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:dask","library:mlcroissant","library:polars","region:us"],"createdAt":"2022-11-07T15:44:15.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"680e46c0aef3594ba697482b","id":"Heschmat/news-headlines-dataset-sarcasm-detection","author":"Heschmat","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2025-04-27T15:01:36.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"2ba33705c88084e808bc73ead1c30251080e41b7","downloads":173,"tags":["license:bsd-3-clause-clear","size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:mlcroissant","library:polars","region:us"],"createdAt":"2025-04-27T15:01:20.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"621ffdd236468d709f181fcc","id":"community-datasets/times_of_india_news_headlines","author":"community-datasets","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2024-01-18T11:17:12.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"245d40b2520a2a2210a71930705816e720370889","citation":"@data{DVN/DPQMQH_2020,\nauthor = {Kulkarni, Rohit},\npublisher = {Harvard Dataverse},\ntitle = {{Times of India News Headlines}},\nyear = {2020},\nversion = {V1},\ndoi = {10.7910/DVN/DPQMQH},\nurl = {https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/DPQMQH}\n}","description":"This news dataset is a persistent historical archive of noteable events in the Indian subcontinent from start-2001 to mid-2020, recorded in realtime by the journalists of India. It contains approximately 3.3 million events published by Times of India. Times Group as a news agency, reaches out a very wide audience across Asia and drawfs every other agency in the quantity of english articles published per day. Due to the heavy daily volume over multiple years, this data offers a deep insight into Indian society, its priorities, events, issues and talking points and how they have unfolded over time. It is possible to chop this dataset into a smaller piece for a more focused analysis, based on one or more facets.","downloads":109,"tags":["task_categories:text-retrieval","task_ids:document-retrieval","task_ids:fact-checking-retrieval","task_ids:text-simplification","annotations_creators:no-annotation","language_creators:expert-generated","multilinguality:monolingual","source_datasets:original","language:en","license:cc0-1.0","size_categories:1M<n<10M","region:us"],"createdAt":"2022-03-02T23:29:22.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"66e6cd431445942fb4684baf","id":"nazimali/kurdish-news-headlines","author":"nazimali","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2024-09-15T12:08:14.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"2863052dae026b07973991dde1dff2729b2e5c74","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Card for Kurdish News Dataset Headlines (KNDH)\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSummary\n\t\n\nDescription from the paper: the Kurdish language belongs to the Indo-Iranian family of Indo-European languages. It is well-known to be a close relative to the Persian language. The speakers span the intersections of Iran, Turkey, Iraq, and Syria. The Kurdish language is one of the official languages in Iraq and has regional status in Iran. The language has 40 million speakers [2,11].\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUsage… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nazimali/kurdish-news-headlines.","downloads":101,"tags":["task_categories:text-classification","task_categories:translation","language:ku","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:dask","library:mlcroissant","library:polars","region:us","kurdish","translation","news"],"createdAt":"2024-09-15T12:04:19.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"642d1b125a7f7ea9de1ff2cc","id":"flowfree/crypto-news-headlines","author":"flowfree","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2023-04-05T06:54:43.000Z","likes":11,"private":false,"sha":"864935f56dacd91f8235a21cf038e7eacaf8b556","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Card for \"crypto-news-headlines\"\n\t\n\nMore Information needed\n","downloads":77,"tags":["size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:mlcroissant","library:polars","region:us"],"createdAt":"2023-04-05T06:54:10.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"621ffdd236468d709f18208e","id":"Adnan/Urdu_News_Headlines","author":"Adnan","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2021-03-01T08:39:32.000Z","likes":2,"private":false,"sha":"ff03997abd68557faa8338de04da6c318b8da8bc","downloads":74,"tags":["region:us"],"createdAt":"2022-03-02T23:29:22.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a99122b0802437e90d73a71","id":"KhadijaMir/SP_DOW_NASDAQ_stocks__News_Headlines_labeled","author":"KhadijaMir","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-24T06:17:11.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"26d89cc4c044979f8f428de6d88fbc3252aac29e","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tS&P / DOW / NASDAQ news headlines, labeled ticker-day events (FTEC 6V96)\n\t\n\nEach branch holds one stage of the course project, so every lesson's data and notebook stay together.\n\n\t\n\t\t\nBranch\nWhat it holds\n\n\n\t\t\nmain (this page)\nTicker-day data before filtering: 110,905 rows with headline, Open, Close, returns, label. Same row count as the course's model_data.h5.\n\n\npost_processing\nThe filtered ticker-day events used in HW1, HW2 and Project 1 (91,851 rows). Partitions: test <=… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/KhadijaMir/SP_DOW_NASDAQ_stocks__News_Headlines_labeled.","downloads":68,"tags":["size_categories:100K<n<1M","format:parquet","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us"],"createdAt":"2026-09-03T06:22:35.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"661cf733aaf5e239f164ea18","id":"steve1989/financial_news_headlines","author":"steve1989","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2024-04-15T18:33:49.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"56ac3466432ce4caad0f608d29690feb218b5494","downloads":67,"tags":["size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:mlcroissant","library:polars","doi:10.57967/hf/2924","region:us"],"createdAt":"2024-04-15T09:45:23.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"66b4a02206ad84ad46dc9044","id":"Yehor/news-headlines-ubercorpus","author":"Yehor","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2025-02-19T18:03:32.000Z","likes":1,"private":false,"sha":"9ba0fc441205c61dc69062fe39c70c410353c4e8","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCommunity\n\t\n\n\nDiscord: https://bit.ly/discord-uds\nNatural Language Processing: https://t.me/nlp_uk\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains news headlines extracted from Ubercorpus.\nAttribution to the dataset:\n\nChaplynskyi, D. et al. (2021) lang-uk Ukrainian Ubercorpus [Data set]. https://lang.org.ua/uk/corpora/#anchor4\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCite this work\n\t\n\n@misc {smoliakov_2025,\n    author       = { {Smoliakov} },\n    title        = { news-headlines-ubercorpus (Revision e2b76f6) }… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Yehor/news-headlines-ubercorpus.","downloads":60,"tags":["language:uk","license:cc-by-nc-sa-4.0","size_categories:1M<n<10M","format:parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:mlcroissant","library:polars","doi:10.57967/hf/4564","region:us","uk"],"createdAt":"2024-08-08T10:38:26.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"69c0213ad0465aacacb3f749","id":"dnakhla/us-news-headlines-enriched","author":"dnakhla","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-03-22T18:39:11.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"06e3248aa480de282e72d9a4419e6355507b4b2f","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUS News Headlines Enriched\n\t\n\nA longitudinal, enriched dataset of 143,142 US news headlines spanning 2015 to 2026 from 13 major outlets. Every headline is enriched with NER, topic clusters, sentiment scores, semantic anchor distances, and Vextant media framing scores. Pre-computed text-embedding-3-small embeddings (1536-dim) are included as a separate file.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nStat\nValue\n\n\n\t\t\nTotal headlines\n143,142\n\n\nCurrent era (2025-2026)\n118,113\n\n\nHistorical… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dnakhla/us-news-headlines-enriched.","downloads":56,"tags":["task_categories:text-classification","task_categories:feature-extraction","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:100K<n<1M","format:parquet","format:optimized-parquet","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","news","headlines","media-framing","sentiment-analysis","NER","topic-modeling","embeddings","longitudinal","us-news"],"createdAt":"2026-03-22T17:04:58.000Z","key":""}]